<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Muhammad & Lamyaa — Wedding Invitation</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@200;300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f6f5ea;
            --ink: #454620;
            --gold: #b39b6e;
            --soft: #e8e6d5;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .invitation-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--soft);
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        .families {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #777;
            margin: 25px 0 15px 0;
        }
        .event-details {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .date-box {
            background: var(--bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border: 1px solid var(--soft);
        }
        .date-box h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 22px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--gold);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="invitation-card">
        <div class="subtitle">THE INVITATION</div>
        <h1>MUHAMMAD & LAMYAA</h1>
        
        <div class="families">TOGETHER WITH THEIR FAMILIES</div>
        <div class="event-details">
            Request the pleasure of your company<br>
            ON THE OCCASION OF THEIR MARRIAGE
        </div>

        <div class="date-box">
            <h3>Friday · 27 November 2026</h3>
            <p><strong>VENUE:</strong> VIP Hall</p>
            <p><strong>LOCATION:</strong> Rehanna Plaza Hotel - Nasr City</p>
        </div>

        <a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=Muhammad%20%26%20Lamyaa%20%E2%80%94%20Wedding&dates=20261127T180000/20261127T220000&ctz=Africa/Cairo&details=Wedding%20Celebration&location=VIP%20Hall%2C%20Rehanna%20Plaza%20Hotel%2C%20Nasr%20City%2C%20Cairo%2C%20Egypt" class="btn" target="_blank">ADD TO GOOGLE CALENDAR</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
